# Secrets manifest
#
# One path per line, relative to the repo root. These are the plaintext files
# that `bun run secrets:encrypt` will encrypt (to `<path>.age`) and
# `bun run secrets:decrypt` will restore.
#
# - Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored.
# - Add any config you want secured here — it does not have to be a .env file.
# - The plaintext paths listed here MUST stay gitignored. Only the `.age`
#   ciphertext gets committed.

